RULE TheGlobalMetadataEntryCarriesLogisticsPaused
	HOLDS_FOR @GAME_RELEASE.2.102
	DOMAIN format
	SPEC "the global metadata entry carries logisticsPaused, a boolean; one written before 2.102"
		+ "has no such key"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section0-player-progression.schema.json::\"logisticsPaused\""
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/infrastructure/validateSaveContent.spec.js::written"
			+ "by the Skeo update and carries logisticsPaused"
	APPLIES_TO_SECTION @SECTION.GlobalMetadata
	RATIONALE "Game release 2.102, the Skeo update, adds logisticsPaused, the state of the drone"
		+ "button stop and recall all drones, written as false on save"
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.102
	SOURCE "The PCEdit save diff between 2.008 and 2.102, read on 2026-09-21, and the sample save"
		+ "written by 2.103 in the private context, whose metadata entry ends on logisticsPaused"
		+ "false"
		REF @URL.PceditSaveDiff
		REF @PROJECT.DNC

RULE ALegacySaveCarriesTerrainLayersInTwelveParts
	HOLDS_FOR @GAME_RELEASE.1.618
	DOMAIN format
	SPEC "a save written by 1.618 or earlier splits into 12 parts, Terrain Layers at index 9, which"
		+ "shifts World Events to index 10"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/sectionIndexes.js::LEGACY_TERRAIN_LAYERS_SECTION_INDEX"
			+ "= 9"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/testing/createSaveRecords.js::PC-Toxicity-Layer2"
	SPEC "the game writes the six properties of the table in every Terrain Layers entry it writes,"
		+ "and no other"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/legacyTerrainLayerProperties.json::colorCustomLerp"
	VALUES_FROM @DATATABLE.LegacyTerrainLayerProperties
	APPLIES_TO_SECTION @SECTION.TerrainLayers
	SOURCE "Extracted from the section index module and the legacy normalisation on 2026-09-23"
	SOURCE "Measured on 2026-09-24 on the reference saves Standard-1, Standard-3 and Standard-4:"
		+ "their 66 layer entries all carry the six properties of the table and no other, each"
		+ "colour four numbers separated by dashes, each intensity an integer up to 101"
		PR 141
		REF @PROJECT.DNC

RULE TheGameKeepsDeprecatedPhytoplanktonGroupIds
	HOLDS_FOR @GAME_RELEASE.2.102
	DOMAIN game
	DOMAIN format
	SPEC "a world object or an item whose group id is Phytoplankton2 or Phytoplankton3 loads as"
		+ "that phytoplankton in play and is written back under the same group id"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::Phytoplankton2"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/testing/createFakeSaveContent.js::Phytoplankton3"
	APPLIES_TO_SECTION @SECTION.WorldObjects
	RATIONALE "Release 2.102 replaced Phytoplankton B and C with one variant in recipes and"
		+ "generators, yet the game still knows both ids: a save carrying them loads them as they"
		+ "are rather than converting them"
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.102
	SOURCE "Owner's manual test in game 2.103, 2026-09-24: other-player_valid.json kept"
		+ "Phytoplankton B in play and Phytoplankton2 in the file written, baseline_valid.json the"
		+ "same for Phytoplankton3"
		PR 127
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.103

RULE AMachineTheGameShowsDrawingNoPowerAddsNothingToConsumption
	HOLDS_FOR all
	DOMAIN game
	SPEC "ButterflyDisplayer1, FishDisplayer1, FrogDisplayer1, Server1, CookingStation1,"
		+ "PodUnderground and RocketAnimals2 placed on a planet add nothing to the consumption the"
		+ "HUD prints"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::placedOnToxicity(41000008,"
			+ "'PodUnderground', 40)"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/PlanetEnergyGrid.spec.ts::should charge the"
			+ "85 kW the game shows, TreePlanter3 being the only one drawing power"
	RATIONALE "The seven machines stay in the group without a known energy level, where nothing is"
		+ "charged, so the computed consumption matches the HUD without a zero-kilowatt row. The"
		+ "fixture holds one of each so that the rule, read on a private save, is attested on a"
		+ "save CI generates"
		REF @TASK.TEST125
		REF @DECISION.AZeroInTheGameDataExportIsNotAPrice
	SOURCE "Owner's reading in game 2.103 of 2026-09-25 on a private save placing nearly every"
		+ "machine: ButterflyDisplayer1, FishDisplayer1, FrogDisplayer1, Server1, CookingStation1,"
		+ "PodUnderground and RocketAnimals2 draw none"
		PR 178
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.103
		REF @PROJECT.DNC

RULE APlanetConsumesTheSumOfTheBaseLevelsOfItsMachines
	HOLDS_FOR all
	DOMAIN game
	SPEC "the consumption the HUD prints for a planet whose machines stand on dry ground, in a save"
		+ "whose modifierPowerConsumption is 1, is the sum of their base consumption levels"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::placedOnToxicity(41000002,"
			+ "'TreePlanter3', 10)"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/PlanetEnergyGrid.spec.ts::should sum the"
			+ "consumption of the placed world objects with known consumption levels"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/PlanetEnergyGrid.spec.ts::should charge the"
			+ "85 kW the game shows, TreePlanter3 being the only one drawing power"
	SPEC "an optimizer adds its own base consumption level to the sum, and no fuse it holds changes"
		+ "the consumption of any machine"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::placedOnToxicity(41000011,"
			+ "'Optimizer2', -10, OTHER_FUSE_OPTIMIZER_INVENTORY_ID)"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/domain/PlanetEnergyGrid.spec.ts::should charge each"
			+ "optimizer its base level, the fuses it holds changing no consumption"
	VALUES_FROM @DATATABLE.EnergyLevels
	RATIONALE "A machine under water draws nothing, which the save cannot tell. A fuse acts on"
		+ "production alone, so the fuses an optimizer holds leave the sum as it is. Any other"
		+ "modifierPowerConsumption multiplies the sum"
		REF @LIMITATION.SubmergedMachinesAreCountedAsDrawingPower
		REF @TASK.TEST125
		REF @RULE.EveryDifficultyModifierOfTheSaveMultipliesTheQuantityItNames
	SOURCE "Owner's reading in game 2.103 of 2026-09-25 on a private save: the HUD of Skeo and of"
		+ "Toxicity matches the computed consumption, and on Prime the only gap is the 165.5 kW of"
		+ "four machines under a lake; TreePlanter3 draws 85 kW"
		PR 178
		REF @GAME_RELEASE.2.103
		REF @PROJECT.DNC
	SOURCE "Owner's answer of 2026-09-26 while promoting TEST125: fuses have never changed the"
		+ "consumption, in any game release"

RULE EveryDifficultyModifierOfTheSaveMultipliesTheQuantityItNames
	HOLDS_FOR all
	DOMAIN game
	SPEC "modifierTerraformationPace, modifierPowerConsumption, modifierGaugeDrain and"
		+ "modifierMeteoOccurence each multiply the quantity the game derives from them: the"
		+ "terraformation pace, the consumption of machines, the depletion of the player's vitals"
		+ "and the occurrence of weather events; at 1 that quantity is the game's default"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section8-save-config.schema.json::Terraformation"
			+ "speed multiplier"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section8-save-config.schema.json::Energy"
			+ "consumption multiplier"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section8-save-config.schema.json::Player"
			+ "gauge depletion multiplier"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section8-save-config.schema.json::Weather"
			+ "event frequency multiplier"
	SPEC "at 0 a modifier still multiplies: the quantity it applies to is zero"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/shared-save-processing/schemas/section8-save-config.schema.json::Energy"
			+ "consumption multiplier"
	SPEC "modifierPowerConsumption multiplies the consumption of every machine: at 1 the HUD prints"
		+ "the base consumption levels, at 1.5 a machine drawing 0.4 kW draws 0.6 kW"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::modifierPowerConsumption: 1.0"
	SPEC "a player sets modifierPowerConsumption between 0 and 2"
		ATTESTED_BY "scripts/generate-scenario-fixtures.ts::modifierPowerConsumption: 1.0"
	APPLIES_TO_SECTION @SECTION.SaveConfiguration
	RATIONALE "The rule states only that each modifier is a plain factor, with no formula for the"
		+ "quantity it multiplies. modifierMultiplayerTerraformationFactor is left out, the owner's"
		+ "answer not naming it. The energy fixture carries modifierPowerConsumption 1, the value"
		+ "every standard reference save carries, so that the HUD reads the base levels. Applying"
		+ "the modifier to the computed consumption is FEAT126; a test pins the multiplied value"
		+ "once that task computes it"
		REF @TASK.FEAT126
		REF @TASK.TEST125
	SOURCE "Owner's reading in game of 2026-09-26: at modifierPowerConsumption 1 the consumption is"
		+ "the default one, at 1.5 a consumption of 0.4 becomes 0.6, and the game offers values"
		+ "from 0 to 2"
		PR 188
	SOURCE "Owner's answer of 2026-09-26 on PR 188: every coefficient of the save works that way"
		+ "(terraformationPace, meteo occurrences, vitals depletion...), for every game release; at"
		+ "0 a coefficient remains a multiplier"
		PR 188
